---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — Pune Bookies"
  description="What we count, what the inquiry form stores, and what we'll never do with either."
  path="/privacy"
  navLinks={[
    { href: '/#manifesto', label: 'Manifesto' },
    { href: '/#sundays', label: 'Sundays' },
    { href: '/brands', label: 'For brands' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="privacy">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose-column">
        <div class="manifesto-eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow">the small print, kept small</span></div>
        <h1 class="display">What we know <em>about you.</em></h1>

        <p>Honestly, not much. Here's the complete list.</p>

        <h2>What we count</h2>
        <p>
          We count visits the way a shopkeeper counts footfall — anonymously, in aggregate,
          using self-hosted analytics (Umami) that sets no cookies and builds no profiles.
          We can see that <em>someone</em> read the brands page; we cannot see that <em>you</em> did.
          No consent banner because there's nothing to consent to.
        </p>

        <h2>The inquiry form</h2>
        <p>
          If you write to us through the partnerships form, we store what you typed —
          your name, brand, email, and message — in our content system, where Tanvi and
          Shrey (and nobody else) read it and reply. It stays there as our record of the
          conversation. Want it gone? Email us and it's gone.
        </p>

        <h2>What we don't do</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>No advertising trackers, no pixels, no fingerprinting.</li>
          <li>No selling, sharing, or "partnering" with anyone about your data.</li>
          <li>No newsletter you didn't ask for. (No newsletter at all, currently.)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Photos at Sundays</h2>
        <p>
          We photograph Sundays for Instagram and this site. The group photo at 9:50 is
          opt-in by walking into it — step aside and nobody minds, no explanation needed.
          If a photo of you is up somewhere and you'd rather it weren't, message
          @pune_bookies and it comes down. No forms, no fuss.
        </p>

        <h2>Questions, removals, complaints</h2>
        <p>
          Tanvi · tanvi.lele3944@gmail.com<br />
          Shrey · shreyasjadhav531@gmail.com
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
